cray-sls-postgres-1            |          https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/auth-trust.html
cray-sls-postgres-1            |          In Docker's default configuration, this is effectively any other
cray-sls-postgres-1            |          container on the same system.
cray-sls-postgres-1            | 
cray-sls-postgres-1            |          It is not recommended to use POSTGRES_HOST_AUTH_METHOD=trust. Replace
cray-sls-postgres-1            |          it with "-e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=password" instead to set a password in
cray-sls-postgres-1            |          "docker run".
cray-sls-postgres-1            | ********************************************************************************
cray-sls-postgres-1            | The files belonging to this database system will be owned by user "postgres".
cray-sls-postgres-1            | This user must also own the server process.
